Hard was solved by Grok after a long run, so it cannot ship. The script still completes the level’s third attempt, then it will use `escalate()` to widen the coefficient search at fixed certificate length; that is the authorized fixed-needle axis.
diff --git a/gen_1408_5515.py b/gen_1408_5515.py
